    "detailed_description": "RoboJep is a Platforming/Physics Based Puzzle Game. Fly through obstacles, solve small puzzles and avoid dangerous obstacles!<br><br>Progress through 15 levels and at the end, you will be fighting the Narrator!<br><br><br>  \u3010Features\u3011<br><br>                                    \u3010<strong>Take advantage of the Physics Flight System!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                    \u3010<strong>Traverse dangerous obstacles! Some of them are moving :)</strong> \u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>Carry objects to their destination to unlock locations!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>Your gonna be dying a lot :)</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>And finally meet the Narrator!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "RoboJep is a Platforming/Physics Based Puzzle Game. Fly through obstacles, solve small puzzles and avoid dangerous obstacles!<br><br>Progress through 15 levels and at the end, you will be fighting the Narrator!<br><br><br>  \u3010Features\u3011<br><br>                                    \u3010<strong>Take advantage of the Physics Flight System!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/38c66596b2ad67b42c5b65839ee49874.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                    \u3010<strong>Traverse dangerous obstacles! Some of them are moving :)</strong> \u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/5a84c43265a1bedd85adf8d0e6f42521.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>Carry objects to their destination to unlock locations!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/313718e943876419c9a47198a614780e.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>Your gonna be dying a lot :)</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/9e2bdce697e851c6159ceeba3b3b8d26.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>                                   \u3010<strong>And finally meet the Narrator!</strong>\u3011<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.poster.avif?t=1691193405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.webm?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715580/extras/780eeb7f47f2687f534699643b2a6e5c.mp4?t=1691193405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
